"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000423","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"孫武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001065","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0177","start":177,"end":180,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0187","start":187,"end":190,"surface":"鄖公弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"鄖公之弟，與鄖公本人分開；未補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"鄖公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001068","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000423","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0213","start":213,"end":215,"surface":"伯嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001064","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m028-0216","start":216,"end":218,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000421","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p029","text":"十年春，越聞吳王之在郢，國空，乃伐吳。吳使別兵撃越。楚告急秦，秦遣兵救楚撃吳，吳師敗。闔廬弟夫槩見秦越交敗吳，吳王留楚不去，夫槩亡歸吳而自立爲吳王。闔廬聞之，乃引兵歸，攻夫槩。夫槩敗奔楚。楚昭王乃得以九月復入郢，而封夫槩於堂谿，爲堂谿氏。十一年，吳王使太子夫差伐楚，取番。楚恐而去郢徙鄀。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"闔廬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"夫槩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001067","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m029-0126","start":126,"end":130,"surface":"太子夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000434","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p018","text":"昭侯十年，朝楚昭王，持美裘二，獻其一於昭王而自衣其一。楚相子常欲之，不與。子常讒蔡侯，留之楚三年。蔡侯知之，乃獻其裘於子常；子常受之，乃言歸蔡侯。蔡侯歸而之晉，請與晉伐楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"子常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001066","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m018-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","book_id":"b-shiji-035","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p019","text":"十三年春，與衛靈公會邵陵。蔡侯私於周萇弘以求長於衛；衛使史言康叔之功德，乃長衛。夏，為晉滅沈，楚怒，攻蔡。蔡昭侯使其子為質於吳，以共伐楚。冬，與吳王闔閭遂破楚入郢。蔡怨子常，子常恐，奔鄭。十四年，吳去而楚昭王復國。十六年，楚令尹為其民泣以謀蔡，蔡昭侯懼。二十六年，孔子如蔡。楚昭王伐蔡，蔡恐，告急於吳。吳為蔡遠，約遷以自近，易以相救；昭侯私許，不與大夫計。吳人來救蔡，因遷蔡于州來。二十八年，昭侯將朝于吳，大夫恐其復遷，乃令賊利殺昭侯；已而誅賊利以解過，而立昭侯子朔，是為成侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"衛靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"周萇弘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001409","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定稱呼、國別指代或數位校勘字樣；不補人名、成員與闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"康叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000190","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"蔡昭侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001452","status":"contex