resolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定稱呼、國別指代或數位校勘字樣；不補人名、成員與闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0212","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"賊利","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001410","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0215","start":215,"end":217,"surface":"昭侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"賊利","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001410","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"昭侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001407","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0232","start":232,"end":233,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001411","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m019-0236","start":236,"end":238,"surface":"成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001411","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","book_id":"b-shiji-035","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p025","text":"湣公六年，孔子適陳。吳王夫差伐陳，取三邑而去。十三年，吳復來伐陳，陳告急楚，楚昭王來救，軍於城父，吳師去。是年，楚昭王卒於城父。時孔子在陳。十五年，宋滅曹。十六年，吳王夫差伐齊，敗之艾陵，使人召陳侯。陳侯恐，如吳。楚伐陳。二十一年，齊田常弒其君簡公。二十三年，楚之白公勝殺令尹子西、子綦，襲惠王。葉公攻敗白公，白公自殺。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"湣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001504","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m025-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m025-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"吳王夫差","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000434","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m025-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000426","status":"contextual_provisio